{'symbol': 'MAA', 'date': '2022-12-13 16:19:00', 'title': 'MAA ANNOUNCES 12% INCREASE TO QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'GERMANTOWN, TENN. , DEC. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MAA (NYSE: MAA)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.40 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID ON JANUARY 31, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 13, 2023, REPRESENTING A 12% INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR RATE.'}